**symbols.hpp maps `game` engine functions and globals to fixed executable addresses via `symbol<T>` and `game_offset`.**

## Exported engine functions

- `Com_Printf: symbol<void(int channel, const char* fmt, ...)>`; `Com_Error: symbol<void(int a1, int a2, int a3, char* Format, ...)>`; `Conbuf_AppendText: symbol<void(int channel, const char* fmt)>`.
- `CL_KeyEvent_: symbol<void()>`; `CL_DrawScreen: symbol<void()>`; `Con_DrawConsole: symbol<void()>`; `Con_DrawSolidConsole: symbol<void()>`; `Con_KeyEvent: symbol<void()>`; `Con_SetConsoleRect: symbol<void()>`; `Con_DrawVersionString: symbol<void()>`; `Con_DrawTextLimited: symbol<void()>`; `Con_DrawText: symbol<void()>`.
- `ConDrawInput_DrawInputText: symbol<char(unsigned char* text)>`; `ConDrawInput_GetInput: symbol<int(unsigned char* text)>`; `ConDrawInput_DrawInput: symbol<void()>`; `Sys_ShowConsole: symbol<void()>`; `Con_CancelAutoComplete: symbol<void()>`.
- `DB_LoadXAssets: symbol<int(XZoneInfo* zoneInfo, int zoneCount, int sync)>`; `DB_WaitXAssets: symbol<int()>`; `DB_LinkXAssetEntry: symbol<XAssetEntry*(XAssetEntry* entry, int allowOverride)>`.
- `DB_EnumXAssets_FastFile: symbol<void(XAssetType type, void(*)(XAssetHeader, void*), const void* userdata, bool overrides)>`; `DB_FindXAssetHeader: symbol<XAssetHeader(XAssetType type, const char* name)>`; `DB_FindXAssetHeader_Internal: symbol<XAssetHeader(XAssetType type, const char* name, int create_default)>`.
- `Dvar_RegisterNew: symbol<dvar_s*(const char* dvarName, DvarType type, unsigned short flags, const char* description, int unk, DvarValue value, DvarLimits domain)>`.
- `R_AddCmdDrawStretchPic: symbol<void(float x, float y, float width, float height, float s0, float t0, float s1, float t1, float* color, Material* material, int unknown)>`; `R_AddCmdDrawText: symbol<void(const char* text, int maxChars, Font_s* font, float x, float y, float xScale, float yScale, float rotation, const float* color, int style)>`.
- `R_EndFrame: symbol<int()>`; `R_IssueDrawCmd: symbol<int(float arg)>`; `R_TextWidth: symbol<int(const char* text, int maxChars, Font_s* font)>`.
- `Scr_LoadScript_: symbol<int(const char* name)>`; `Scr_FormatCodePos: symbol<char*(char* result, int a2)>`; `SV_AddTestClient: symbol<void*()>`; `SV_BotFrame: symbol<void()>`; `SV_BotUserMove: symbol<void()>`.
- `SV_ClientThink: symbol<void()>`; `SV_ClientEnterWorld: symbol<void*(int client_ptr, int* userinfo)>`; `SV_ClientUserinfoChanged: symbol<void(int clientNum)>`.
- `GScr_AddTestClient: symbol<void()>`; `Scr_SightTracePassed: symbol<void()>`; `Scr_BulletTracePassed: symbol<void()>`; `ClientScr_SetNormalHealth: symbol<void()>`; `ClientScr_GetNormalHealth: symbol<void()>`.
- `CL_ConsolePrint: symbol<void(int localClientNum, int channel, const char* txt, int duration, int pixelWidth, int flags)>`; `generateHashValue: symbol<int(char* dvar)>`.

