## ABI and integration contracts

- `WEAK` expands to `__declspec(selectany)`, enabling weak/select-any address-bound definitions; every `symbol<T>` initializer uses a hard-coded `game_offset(...)`.
- `DB_XAssetGetNameHandler_t` aliases `const char* (*)(game::XAssetHeader* asset)`, while `DB_XAssetGetNameHandler` is an external `DB_XAssetGetNameHandler_t*` associated with `IW3SP-MOD`.
- `symbol`, `game_offset`, `XAssetHeader`, `XAssetType`, `XAssetEntry`, `XZoneInfo`, `dvar_s`, `DvarType`, `DvarValue`, `DvarLimits`, `Font_s`, `Material`, `cmd_function_s`, `scrMemTreePub_t`, `XAssetEntryPoolEntry`, `XZone`, `PlayerKeyState`, `ScreenPlacement`, `scrVmPub_t`, `field_t`, `HWND`, and `DWORD` must be declared by included project/platform headers.